<!--
    Punjabi (Gurmukhi), a draft not yet read by a fluent reviewer (#495). The notes on each string are in values/strings.xml.
    "Vehicle" is ਗੱਡੀ, for whatever the agency runs; "run" is ਫੇਰਾ; "trip" is ਟ੍ਰਿਪ (feminine); "report" is ਰਿਪੋਰਟ
    (feminine, plural ਰਿਪੋਰਟਾਂ), and "reporting" is ਰਿਪੋਰਟਿੰਗ; "dispatcher" is ਕੰਟਰੋਲ ਰੂਮ; "block" is ਬਲਾਕ;
    "riders" is ਸਵਾਰੀਆਂ; "diagnostics" is ਐਪ ਦੀ ਜਾਣਕਾਰੀ. Location, precise location, "all the time", notifications
    and settings are Android's own Punjabi words: ਟਿਕਾਣਾ, ਸਹੀ ਟਿਕਾਣਾ, ਹਰ ਵੇਲੇ, ਸੂਚਨਾਵਾਂ, ਸੈਟਿੰਗਾਂ. "App" (ਐਪ) is
    feminine, as Android's Punjabi has it.
-->
